{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/why-i-switched-from-wispr-flow-to-voiceink/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"id":"869f2b0b-c61b-5e9d-9df2-ed5a15e4f922","html":"<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/71c1d/image1.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 66.66666666666666%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/8ac56/image1.webp 240w,\n/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/d3be9/image1.webp 480w,\n/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/e46b2/image1.webp 960w,\n/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/f992d/image1.webp 1440w,\n/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/0abaa/image1.webp 1536w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/8ff5a/image1.png 240w,\n/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/e85cb/image1.png 480w,\n/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/d9199/image1.png 960w,\n/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/07a9c/image1.png 1440w,\n/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/71c1d/image1.png 1536w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/d9199/image1.png\"\n            alt=\"Why I Switched from Wispr Flow to VoiceInk\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>I’ve been using voice-to-text tools for a while now. They save time, reduce friction when writing, and allow me to capture thoughts faster than typing. Recently, I switched from <a href=\"https://wisprflow.ai/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Wispr Flow</a> to <a href=\"https://tryvoiceink.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">VoiceInk</a>, and I want to share why.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-cost-problem\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#the-cost-problem\" aria-label=\"the cost problem permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>The Cost Problem</h2>\n<p>Wispr Flow works well. I have no major complaints about the quality. But the Pro plan costs $12 per month, and over time, that started to feel expensive for what it does.</p>\n<p>Voice-to-text is a utility. It takes what I say and turns it into text. Paying a recurring monthly fee for that kind of tool didn’t feel right to me, given the long-term cost.</p>\n<h2 id=\"why-voiceink\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#why-voiceink\" aria-label=\"why voiceink permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Why VoiceInk</h2>\n<p>VoiceInk costs $25, one time. No monthly charges, no annual renewal. You pay once, and you’re done.</p>\n<p>For a tool that does essentially the same job, that pricing model made a lot more sense to me. The value I get doesn’t decrease over time, so the price shouldn’t keep repeating either.</p>\n<p>Beyond the pricing, a couple of other factors made the switch easier.</p>\n<p><strong>Privacy.</strong> VoiceInk processes transcription locally on your device by default. Your voice data doesn’t leave your machine. If you care about where your data goes, that’s a considerable difference.</p>\n<p><strong>Model flexibility.</strong> VoiceInk supports multiple transcription models. You can use local AI models for completely offline transcription, such as NVIDIA’s Parakeet V2 (I use this because it is faster), Gemini 2.5 Pro, or Groq v3 turbo. You’re not locked into a single provider.</p>\n<p><strong>iOS app.</strong> Like Wispr Flow, VoiceInk also has an iOS application, so you can use it on your phone as well. That said, the macOS experience is noticeably more fluid and polished compared to the iOS version. For most of my work, I stick to the Mac app.</p>\n<h2 id=\"final-thoughts\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#final-thoughts\" aria-label=\"final thoughts permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Final Thoughts</h2>\n<p>Wispr Flow is a solid tool, and if you’re already happy with it, there’s nothing wrong with sticking to it. But if you’re looking for something more affordable in the long run with strong privacy and flexibility, VoiceInk is worth considering.</p>\n<p>Sometimes the best upgrade is the one that costs you less. ✌️</p>","timeToRead":1,"fields":{"slug":"/posts/2026-03-17---why-i-switched-from-wispr-flow-to-voiceink//posts/why-i-switched-from-wispr-flow-to-voiceink","tagSlugs":["/tag/productivity/","/tag/voice-to-text/","/tag/developer-tools/"]},"frontmatter":{"date":"2026-03-17T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["Productivity","Voice to Text","Developer Tools"],"title":"Why I Switched from Wispr Flow to VoiceInk","description":"A one-time purchase, local processing, and flexible model options made the switch easy.","socialImage":{"publicURL":"/static/48df664b6f0c5e168f3132f768b4b384/image1.png"}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/2026-03-17---why-i-switched-from-wispr-flow-to-voiceink//posts/why-i-switched-from-wispr-flow-to-voiceink"}},"staticQueryHashes":["4208939363"],"slicesMap":{}}